       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose is well above the safe limit, and I'd like you to confirm it first.\n\n**The problem:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily is **6,400 mg/day**.\n- The usual maximum single dose is **800 mg**.\n- The maximum daily dose for prescription use is **3,200 mg/day**. This order is twice that.\n- At this dose, the risks of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and heart problems go up sharply, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**It may be a transcription error. Did you mean one of these?**\n1. **Ibuprofen 400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day total)\n2. **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n3. **Ibuprofen 800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n4. Something else\n\nTell me which one you want and I'll enter it right away."
