     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you wrote it. **Order ID: ORD-0001**: ibuprofen 1600 mg by mouth, four times daily (6,400 mg/day).\n\nI put a note on the order saying the dose is above the usual maximum, that you were told and confirmed it, and asking for pharmacist verification. Pharmacy may contact you before dispensing it.\n\nIf you continue at this dose, you might consider:\n- **GI protection**, such as a PPI\n- **Kidney monitoring** (BMP/creatinine) and watching urine output\n- **Watching for bleeding** (CBC, stool guaiac if there's any concern) and checking blood pressure and fluid status\n- **Avoiding other NSAIDs, anticoagulants, and nephrotoxic drugs** given at the same time, where possible\n\nIf this was meant to be a lower dose, tell me and I'll help you correct or replace the order."
      }
     ],
